# TripMate — Phase 10: Emergency & Safety Module

## Overview

Phase 10 adds an Emergency & Safety Module to TripMate.

**Core features:**
- Emergency SOS with live geolocation
- Nearby hospitals & police stations (via Geoapify)
- Distance-based sorting (Haversine)
- Google Maps directions
- Emergency contact + one-tap calling
- Static First Aid Guide
- Robust error handling (including partial API failure)

**Main flow:**

```
User → SOS → Geolocation → Lat/Lng → Nearby API → Geoapify → Resources → Distance → Sort → Display
```

