## 2. SOS Flow

```
SOS Button
   ↓
Check Geolocation Support
   ↓
Request Location Permission
   ↓
Get Latitude + Longitude
   ↓
Call Nearby Resource API
   ↓
Get Hospitals + Police
   ↓
Display Results
```

Uses the browser's `navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition()`.

**Note:** This is the user's *current* location — different from Trip Map, which shows the *trip destination*. This makes Emergency useful even when traveling away from the planned destination.

