## 3. Geolocation Error Handling

| Case | Message |
|---|---|
| Permission denied | "Location permission was denied." |
| Position unavailable | "Unable to determine your location." |
| Timeout | "Location request timed out." |
| Unsupported browser | "Geolocation is not supported by your browser." |

Prevents silent failures on the page.

