## 10. Emergency Resource UI

Two sections — **Hospitals** and **Police Stations** — each showing:
- Name
- Distance
- "Get Directions" link

Only the nearest few results are shown to avoid clutter.

**Get Directions** generates a Google Maps URL from lat/lon:
```
https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=<lat>,<lon>
```
Opens in a new tab.

