## 11. Emergency Contact

Stored on the existing `User` model:

```javascript
emergencyContact: {
  name: String,
  phone: String,
  relation: String
}
```

Available via `AuthContext` → current user → `emergencyContact`.

If missing: `"No emergency contact has been added."` (user can add it from Profile).

