## 12. One-Tap Calling

Uses the HTML `tel:` URI — no backend call-processing needed:

```jsx
<a href={`tel:${user.emergencyContact.phone}`}>
  Call Emergency Contact
</a>
```

On supported mobile devices, this opens the dialer directly.

